{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26682","headline":"寄贾岛浪仙 · 姚合","name":"寄贾岛浪仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悄悄掩门扉，穷窘自维絷。\n世途已昧履，生计复乖缉。\n疎我非常性，端峭尔孤立。\n往还纵云久，贫蹇岂自习。\n所居率荒野，宁似在京邑。\n院落夕弥空，虫声雁相及。\n衣巾半僧施，蔬药常自拾。\n凛凛寝席单，翳翳竈烟湿。\n颓篱里人度，败壁邻灯入。\n晓思已暂舒，暮愁还更集。\n风凄林叶萎，苔糁行径涩。\n海峤誓同归，橡栗充朝给。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}